ent-ClothingHeadArafatkaChaos = chaos arafatka
    .desc = A dark battlefield scarf favored by renegades, cultists, and raiders of the warband.

ent-ClothingBeltChaosDynamite = chaos dynamite belt
    .desc = A belt packed with demolition charges. It can only be armed while worn, can be linked to a remote signaller, and turns the wearer into a walking blast wave.

ent-ClothingBeltChaplainMeltaCharge = melta-charge belt
    .desc = A desperate sacrificial belt bearing a melta charge. It can only be armed while worn, and when the timer runs out it annihilates the wearer and bathes nearby targets in white-hot fire.
